px;\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\"><div class=\"envira-gallery-item-inner\"><div class=\"envira-gallery-position-overlay envira-gallery-top-left\"></div><div class=\"envira-gallery-position-overlay envira-gallery-top-right\"></div><div class=\"envira-gallery-position-overlay envira-gallery-bottom-left\"></div><div class=\"envira-gallery-position-overlay envira-gallery-bottom-right\"></div><a class=\"envira-gallery-68025 envira-gallery-link\" href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg\" title=\"Fasting for Weight Loss\" data-caption=\"\" data-envira-item-id=\"68026\" data-envira-retina=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg\" data-thumb=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920-75x50_c.jpeg\" data-title=\"Fasting for Weight Loss\" data-envirabox=\"68025\" itemprop=\"contentUrl\"><div class=\"envira-lazy\" style=\"padding-bottom: 200%;\" data-envira-changed=\"false\" data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"1920\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg\" alt=\"Fasting for Weight Loss\" class=\"envira-gallery-image envira-gallery-image-1    envira-lazy\" height=\"1920\" id=\"envira-gallery-image-68026\" srcset=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" tabindex=\"-1\" title=\"Fasting for Weight Loss\" width=\"960\" data-caption=\"\" data-envira-gallery-id=\"68025\" data-envira-index=\"0\" data-envira-item-id=\"68026\" data-envira-src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg\" data-envira-srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg 400w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg 2x\" data-title=\"Fasting for Weight Loss\" itemprop=\"thumbnailUrl\" data-envirabox=\"68025\"/></div></a><div class=\"envira-gallery-captioned-data envira-gallery-captioned-data-base\"></div></div></div></div></div><noscript><img src='https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2021/07/eng_fasting_infographics-960x1920.jpeg' alt='Fasting for Weight Loss' class='envira_noscript_images ' /></noscript>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Get the PDF version of this infographic <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/qohie4mzesf4w99etg7qcnxqce3jrduo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For all of the videos on fasting, check out our </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/fasting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. Fasting for weight loss is also covered in-depth in Dr. Greger’s book </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Diet</span></i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></a></p>\n<p>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2019: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\"><b>Evidence-Based Weight Loss</b></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></a></li>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></a></li>\n</ul>"
